@baseUrl = https://localhost:8010/camplib/v1
@accessToken = paste-reader-access-token-here

### Provision current reader from IdentityAccessServer token claims
POST {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/provision
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get current reader profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/readers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Complete current reader profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Alice",
  "lastname": "Reader"
}
